@startuml DCMS_Exam_Start_Save_Class_Diagram
title Class Diagram - Bác sĩ khám bệnh (bắt đầu và lưu kết quả khám)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #000000
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ArrowColor #000000
}
hide circle

class ExaminationScreen {
  openVisit()
  enterExaminationContent()
  saveOrConfirm()
  showExaminationData()
}

class ExaminationService {
  startExamination()
  saveExamination()
  validateContent()
}

class ClinicalAccess {
  checkAccess()
}

class Dentist {
  id : int
  accountId : int
  employeeCode : string
  fullName : string
}

class BranchMember {
  branchId : int
  employeeId : int
  active : bool
  canDentist : bool
}

class Patient {
  id : int
  patientCode : string
  fullName : string
  birthDate : DateOnly
  gender : string
}

class Visit {
  id : Guid
  appointmentId : Guid
  patientId : int
  branchId : int
  dentistId : int
  status : string
  version : int
  arrivalAt : DateTimeOffset
  arrivalReason : string
}

class Appointment {
  id : Guid
  code : string
  status : string
  version : int
  startAt : DateTimeOffset
  endAt : DateTimeOffset
}

class Examination {
  visitId : Guid
  content : string
  updatedBy : int
  updatedAt : DateTimeOffset
}

class Investigation {
  id : Guid
  visitId : Guid
  kind : string
  state : string
  requiredForDiagnosis : bool
}

class DiagnosisCatalogEntry {
  id : Guid
  code : string
  name : string
  isActive : bool
  version : int
}

class VisitAudit {
  id : Guid
  visitId : Guid
  actorAccountId : int
  action : string
  occurredAt : DateTimeOffset
  beforeJson : string
  afterJson : string
}

ExaminationScreen -[hidden]down- ExaminationService

ExaminationScreen ..> ExaminationService : calls
ExaminationService ..> ClinicalAccess : checks access
ClinicalAccess ..> BranchMember : reads
ClinicalAccess ..> Visit : reads
ExaminationService ..> Visit : updates status
ExaminationService ..> Appointment : updates status
ExaminationService ..> Examination : saves
ExaminationService ..> Investigation : checks required
ExaminationService ..> DiagnosisCatalogEntry : checks
ExaminationService ..> VisitAudit : records

Patient "1" -- "0..*" Visit : attends
Dentist "1" -- "0..*" Visit : examines
Dentist "1" -- "0..*" BranchMember : works at
Appointment "1" -- "0..1" Visit : becomes
Visit "1" *-- "0..1" Examination : has
Visit "1" *-- "0..*" Investigation : orders
Visit "1" *-- "0..*" VisitAudit : logs

note right of Examination
  Tên dễ đọc = Tên lớp trong code
  Dentist = EmployeeProfile
  BranchMember = SchedulingMember
  Patient = PatientProfile
  Examination = VisitExamination
  Investigation = InvestigationOrder
  DiagnosisCatalogEntry = ReferenceEntry
  ---
  Method = Method trong code
  startExamination = StartAsync
  saveExamination = SaveAsync
  checkAccess = VisitAsync, BranchAsync
end note

@enduml
